{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Upon the river Ahava</b> — it lacks the supporting [word]; the proper form is נהר אהוא (the river Ahava)."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra notes a grammatical issue: the verse says על הנהר אהוא without the expected construct linkage or preposition, when it should read נהר אהוא (the river Ahava)."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:15.324648766Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}